#: src/components/ses-account.tsx:417
msgid "A message that bounced hard, or that somebody reported as spam. Amazon keeps this list itself and honours it whatever this panel does — a bounce costs money and complaints close accounts."
msgstr "Sert şekilde geri dönen ya da birinin spam olarak bildirdiği mesajlar. Amazon bu listeyi kendi tutar ve bu panel ne yaparsa yapsın ona uyar — iade para götürür, şikâyet hesap kapatır."

#: src/components/ses-account.tsx:250
msgid "A new SES account starts in the sandbox, where it may only write to addresses you have verified below. Asking to leave it is how you can write to your visitors."
